    "detailed_description": "This is a composite game that combines transformation, rougelike, devouring, synthesis, parkour and other gameplay methods.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(1) As a slime, the player can eat all enemies in the game except zombies, transform into its appearance, and use its skills.<br />\r\n(2) You can collect your own slime accomplices in the map. After rescuing them, they will use various abilities to help players attack the enemy in the level.<br />\r\n(3) You can also encounter some skills or slime merchants in the game, which can provide players with a variety of skills.<br />\r\n(4) Synthetic gameplay. The slime friends rescued by the player in the level can be synthesized and upgraded in the surrounding slime farm, so that the player can obtain more advanced abilities.<br />\r\n(5) Parkour, follow the game process. You can unlock a building that turns into a taxi. In this building, players can possess the taxi and kill zombies.<br />\r\n(6) Devour, a devour mini-game where players turn into a black hole and can eat all the props on the map.",
